---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="About NurseSynapse — Real Nurse, Honest Reviews"
  description="NurseSynapse is built by a working RN to help nurses navigate NCLEX prep, AI tools, and career resources with honest, experience-based guidance."
>
  <article>
    <h1>About NurseSynapse</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      NurseSynapse exists because nurses deserve honest information — not sponsored content disguised as advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      NurseSynapse is run by a working registered nurse. Not a marketing team. Not a content agency.
      A real clinician who has used these tools, studied for boards, and navigated the evolving
      landscape of AI in healthcare firsthand.
    </p>
    <p>
      When we review an NCLEX prep course, it's based on real experience with the material — not
      a quick skim of the features page. When we cover an AI charting tool, we're thinking about
      how it actually fits into a real shift.
    </p>

    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>NCLEX prep</strong> — honest comparisons of the major courses, what works, what doesn't</li>
      <li><strong>AI tools for nurses</strong> — emerging technology that's actually useful at the bedside or in practice</li>
      <li><strong>Nursing career resources</strong> — CE platforms, scheduling tools, clinical reference apps</li>
      <li><strong>Guides</strong> — practical content for nursing students, new grads, and experienced RNs</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      NurseSynapse uses affiliate links. If you click a link and make a purchase, we may earn a
      commission — at no extra cost to you. This is how we keep the site running without paywalls
      or sponsored content.
    </p>
    <p>
      We only recommend tools and courses we genuinely believe are worth your money and time.
      Affiliate relationships do not influence our reviews or rankings.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions, suggestions, or want to share your experience with a tool? <a href="/contact">Reach out →</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  article { max-width: 68ch; }
  .lede { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  ul { padding-left: 20px; }
  ul li { margin: 8px 0; }
</style>
